{"pageid":4032,"title":"Mysterious Potion","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mysterious Potion</span>","revid":18839,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>\"Drink at your own risk.\"</i>\n</p><p>The Mysterious Potion is a potion that's available to purchase for <i>$1300</i> at the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a>. The Mysterious Potion can be found in the back of the store, next to the furnace-like object, and behind two stacked crates on the right. It will be inside of a miniature crate, likely made to blend in.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 424px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b6/Mysterious_potion_oaklands.png/revision/latest?cb=20250618032135\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A picture of the crate in the Oak Depot that holds the Mysterious Potion, and where it spawns, in Roblox Oaklands.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b6/Mysterious_potion_oaklands.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/424?cb=20250618032135\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"424\" height=\"333\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Mysterious potion oaklands.png\" data-image-key=\"Mysterious_potion_oaklands.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Mysterious_potion_oaklands.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The crate in the Oak Depot that holds the Mysterious Potion, and where it spawns.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The Mysterious potion can be used to teleport randomly around the map, even spots like <a href=\"/wiki/The_Moon\" title=\"The Moon\">the Moon</a> or clouds.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902155718\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nC